# Feature: Invitation Welcome Flow

**Goal**: As an invitee, I want a seamless transition from scanning a QR/Link to being welcomed or logged in, whether I already have the app or not.

## Scenario: New User scans QR (First Time)
  **Given** I do NOT have the Gurudevi app installed
  **And** I scan a "School" invitation QR code for "Royal College"
  **When** I am redirected to the App Store/Play Store
  **And** I install and open the app for the first time
  **Then** the app should remember my "Royal College" invitation
  **And** I should see the "Welcome to Royal College!" screen
  **And** I should see a "Continue to Setup Account" button

## Scenario: Existing User scans QR (Returning User)
  **Given** I already have the Gurudevi app installed and I am logged in
  **And** I scan a "School" invitation QR code for "Royal College"
  **When** the app opens directly
  **Then** I should see a "Join New School" confirmation popup
  **And** I should see "Would you like to join Royal College as a Teacher?"
  **And** I should see "Accept Invitation" and "Decline" buttons

## Scenario: Thuthimal Gift for New User
  **Given** I do NOT have the app installed
  **And** I tap a "Thuthimal" deep link from "Kasun Perera"
  **When** I install and open the app
  **Then** I should immediately see the "Lotus" animation
  **And** I should see the gift message from "Kasun Perera"
  **And** I should see "Accept Gift & Sign Up"

## Scenario: Invalid Invitation Code
  **Given** I open the app via an invalid or expired deep link
  **When** the app finishes loading the link data
  **Then** I should see "This invitation is no longer valid"
  **And** I should be offered to "Enter Code Manually" or "Contact Support"
